## 34、PropertyAnimation：动画属性

<span style="background: yellow">PropertyAnimation可以单独写（手动触发），</span>

<span style="background: yellow">也可以直接写到控件内部（一渲染就执行），</span>

<span style="background: yellow">或transition中（state控制）</span>

```c++
Button {
    onClicked: {
        //点击按钮开始动画或restart
        ani1.start()
    }
}

PropertyAnimation {
    id: ani1

    //动画的作用对象
    target: btn

    //指定对象的哪些属性需要动画
    property: "width"

    //把btn中的width属性值从100改到400时动画生效
    from: 100
    to: 400

    //若动画不流畅可以调整动画的变速类型
    easing.type: Easing.Linear
}

Rectangle {
    id: btn
    width: 100
    height: 40
    color: "red"
    anchors.centerIn: parent

    //控件一渲染就执行动画
    PropertyAnimation on width {
        to: 400
        duration: 1000
    }

    states: [
        //正常状态下按钮为红色，文本为“移出去了”
        State {
            name: "normal"
            PropertyChanges {
                target: btn
                color: "red"
            }
            PropertyChanges {
                target: txt
                text: "移出去了"
            }
        },
        //鼠标移入状态下按钮为黄色，并改变文本
        State {
            name: "hovered"
            PropertyChanges {
                target: btn
                color: "yellow"
            }
            PropertyChanges {
                target: txt
                text: "放进来了"
            }
        }
    ]

    //过渡动画
    transitions: [
        //
        Transition {
            from: "normal"
            to: "hovered"
            //

            ColorAnimation {
                target: btn
                // from: "white"
                // to: "black"
                duration: 200
            }
            PropertyAnimation {
                target: btn
                property: "width"
                to: 100
                duration: 200
            }
        },
        Transition {
            from: "hovered"
